Z||000003||fogglethorpe||08-25-2001||09:21 PM||||Well, not really so well, ya see...I like, got this really painful, pus-filled blister thingee on my left big toe...ooooh, talk about painful! And ya knowhat? I always seem to hit that toe on stuff...like this morning, frinstance, I caught it on the edge of the sofa leg. Damn, that hurt like you wouldn't friggin' believe! And then the dog stepped on it with his left front paw...he didn't mean it, mind you...he's just a big, slobbery, loveable oaf, he is. Anyway, back to the foot thing...I went to the Doc's yesterday, and he said it was an infection of some sort, gave me this gooey stuff in a tube, charged me fifty-six bucks, and sent me packin'. I was like, sheesh, thanks for friggin' nuthin' Docman! So, I can't wear a left sock, and it'll prolly take about four or five days to get where I can drive without pain (it IS my clutch foot, after all). So until then, I'm gonna take a few days off, eat lotsa pasta and ribs, and down a few brewskis in front of the boob tube. What a freakin' life!<P>Other than that, I'm fine. Thanks for asking.||||reg||1
