Z||000017||Butter||08-27-2001||04:42 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Galen:<BR><B>How ya doing?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well Galen you tell me.<BR>Week before last or so I lost my girlfriend of 7 years, lost the barn I had been taking care of and turned into a shop with a real concrete floor (lotsa work gone), lost about half the major tools used to do major work on my Fiero and it's missing 3rd gear, I went from living in a brick house with a good bed to a 10' by 30' trailer with bad plumbing and sleeping on a couch.  I made this decision myself after I asked the X about tying my name to some of the things like the shop where she and her family and some of my family got work done on anything that would fit threw its door at cost.  I needed a loan at the bank to refinance in order to do some things for myself and did not have the colateral to cover the amount I needed.  The bank I'm doing business with went corporate and cut what I could borrow off just my name alone from last year by over $1000 dollars which would have been enough to refinance without any aid from anyone else.  The X could not or would not help.  After a few days she told me to get out so I started to load up my most valued possesions.  She literally rips the shirt off my back as I am leaving with next to the last temporary load and then locks me out of the house at appoximately 7:30am in the morning.  Fortunately I did no violent acts and had already called someone for a crediable witness to the occasion.  As I wait for him or the law (which ever, at that point I didn't care) my friend shows up, talks his way into the house and talked her out of one tee shirt for me to wear.  Next day she wants me to come back. So I foolishly do so trying not to lose 7 years of my life to her and our relationship. Then she took a trip to carry her ailing mother back to her home in NC.  I call to find out how things are going since she arrived and get a really piss poor attitude.  Then I wait a couple of days hoping maybe she would call me in a better mood but the phone does not ring.  So I call her to inquire about thier welfare and she tells me not to call her, she would call me.  In lieu of what has happen I decided to go ahead a get out while I had a good chance to do it peaceful like.  Keeping whatch on her place and making sure her dog is feed till she gets back, she is just amazed that I would do such a thing.  So at her request we try to get back together and she falls back into the same bitchin' person and tells her folks its all my fault.  So I start making arrangements to finish moving and she has the damn nerve to ask me to pay her electric bill and rent on her oxygen and acetylene tanks.  I told her I would not but I would help her secure a way to pay them if I could.  I am REALLY confused at her behavier but I see now I was just being used and I'm tired of that and the bitchin' I been getting everyday.  Now I'm just wondering what to do with the things I have accumilated over the years and how to start over.  Anyone got any good advise for me?  I'm still alive, I still have all my friends which try to help and comfort me, I still have my job of 15 years and get along with all my coworkers.  My moneys for the last 7 years has been used to help her and her farm and as far as I know there is no common law marriage in TN so I'm SOL as far as anything her farm is worth.<P>Other than that I'm doin' just fine but I'm financially and emotionally embarrassed.<P>So, Now Galen, How you doin'?  <BR>||||reg||1
